  "description": "Townhouse for rent in Stoneybatter. House consists of sitting room with solid fuel stove fire, sofa and plenty of storage, including a large built-in bookcase. Kitchen contains integrated washer/dryer, separate undercounter fridge and freezer, slimline dishwasher, ceramic hob, plenty of cupboard space and open shelving.\n\nThere is one toilet/shower room which is downstairs and has a power shower and stone flooring. \n\nUpstairs consists of a comfortable double bedroom at the front with built-in wardrobes and a smaller room at the back which can be utilised as a single bedroom or an office. Back bedroom also has lots of built in wardrobe space and storage and also has a desk and shelves. \n\nCarpeted stairs, landing and bedrooms and natural oak flooring throughout the downstairs. House has gas fired central heating and a solid fuel stove in the sittingroom (not run off the heating system). There is a very small yard at the back which holds the bins and a small washing line. \n\nPerfect for anyone looking for comfortable, modern, easy living that is only a stone's throw from the city centre, close to the Phoenix Park, the NCR, the Luas, Smithfield Village and the M50.",
